# JustAC hand pin, WoW Forever: Restoration Shaman damage (levelling, or nothing to heal). The
# sim list source (tools/forever-apl-src) models no healer. Wowhead's Forever level-30 healer
# overview: spare time goes to Fire Nova on packs or Lightning Bolt
# (Documentation/forever-guides/druid-shaman.md, Shaman - Restoration); Icy Veins' Forever
# Restoration Shaman levelling guide (read 2026-11-17) adds Chain Lightning against several.
# Flame Shock is kept up ahead of Lightning Bolt (2026-11-20 simulation: kills 18 to 25% faster
# at 14 and 30, no change at 60).
# Supported conditions: target.health.pct<N, [!]dot.X.ticking, active_enemies>=N.

actions=fire_nova,if=active_enemies>=3
actions+=/chain_lightning,if=active_enemies>=2
actions+=/flame_shock,if=!dot.flame_shock.ticking
actions+=/lightning_bolt
